          "summary_short": {
            "zh": "该项目将 Andrej Karpathy 关于大语言模型编程常见陷阱的观察提炼成一个 CLAUDE.md 文件，用于优化 Claude Code 的行为。它通过编码最佳实践（如避免过早优化、确保显式错误处理）充当系统提示，引导模型生成更安全、更可靠的代码。开发者只需将此文件放入项目根目录，即可立即改善 Claude 的代码生成质量。这是一个轻量级但实用的工具，适合所有使用 LLM 辅助编程的开发者，帮助他们避免常见错误，提升代码质量。",
            "en": "This project distills Andrej Karpathy's insights on common LLM coding pitfalls into a single CLAUDE.md file that guides Claude Code to produce better outputs. By encoding best practices like avoiding premature optimization and ensuring explicit error handling, it acts as a syste…",
            "es": "This project distills Andrej Karpathy's insights on common LLM coding pitfalls into a single CLAUDE.md file that guides Claude Code to produce better outputs. By encoding best practices like avoiding premature optimization and ensuring explicit error handling, it acts as a syste…"
